<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .header {
        background: #f82b2b;
        color: white;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid #eee;
        border-top: none;
        border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
      }
      .alert-box {
        background: #fff5f5;
        border-left: 4px solid #f82b2b;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .details {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
      }
      .details td {
        padding: 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      }
      .details .label {
        font-weight: bold;
        width: 120px;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #333;
        color: white;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='header'>
      <h1>Low Stock Alert</h1>
    </div>
    <div class='content'>
      <p>Hello Admin,</p>
      <p>This is an automated notification to inform you that a product has
        reached its low stock threshold.</p>

      <div class='alert-box'>
        <strong>Action Required:</strong>
        Please restock this item soon to avoid out-of-stock situations.
      </div>

      <table class='details'>
        <tr>
          <td class='label'>Product Name:</td>
          <td>{{productName}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class='label'>SKU:</td>
          <td>{{sku}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class='label'>Current Stock:</td>
          <td style='color: #f82b2b; font-weight: bold;'>{{quantity}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class='label'>Threshold:</td>
          <td>{{threshold}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <a href='{{inventoryUrl}}' class='btn'>View Inventory</a>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>&copy; 2024 Youshop Ecommerce. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>You are receiving this because you are an administrator.</p>
        <p><a href='{{unsubscribeUrl}}'>Unsubscribe from admin alerts</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>